From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seeed Studio <support@seeed.cc>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] power: charge_animation: initialize fuel-gauge status

Newer GCC versions used by Yocto Wrynose diagnose the debug path as
possibly reading soc and current before the first successful fuel-gauge
poll. Initialize all status values so the vendor U-Boot tree builds with
-Werror=maybe-uninitialized.

Regenerated for the radxa next-dev-v2024.10 tree (the declaration sits
three lines below its old SDK position and the original zero-context
hunk no longer located).

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [vendor tree build compatibility]
---
diff --git a/drivers/power/charge_animation.c b/drivers/power/charge_animation.c
index 89c5db2..dc3ec53 100644
--- a/drivers/power/charge_animation.c
+++ b/drivers/power/charge_animation.c
@@ -579,7 +579,7 @@ static int charge_animation_show(struct udevice *dev)
 	ulong delta;
 	ulong ms = 0, sec = 0;
 	int start_idx = 0, show_idx = -1, old_show_idx = IMAGE_RECALC_IDX;
-	int soc, voltage, current, key_state;
+	int soc = 0, voltage = 0, current = 0, key_state;
 	int i, charging = 1, ret;
 	int boot_mode;
 	int first_poll_fg = 1;
